/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 121 0 R
/T (organisations can no longer solely depend on hiring to solve the skill gaps but also improve how they leverage their existed internal skills to sustain delivery performance.  Competition Pressure  On the other hand, Coditas operates in a highly competitive industry environment with both onshore and offshore service providers. Offshore firms benefit from significant cost advantages, which leads to lowering labour costs by 50-70% \(Putri 2025\). At the same time, the onshore providers distinguish themselves by their close collaboration with the clients and higher local expertise. As cost advantages are widely shared and competition is high, firms cannot rely on pricing to differentiate. Instead, the competitive advantage for a company lies in its efficiency in execution capabilities and high-quality services. Ultimately, the delivery of high-quality services lies in the capability of the engineers within the organization, making effective talent management critical for sustaining this competitive advantage.  Human Capital as a Key Success Factor )
/E (organisations can no longer solely depend on hiring to solve the skill gaps but also improve how they leverage their existed internal skills to sustain delivery performance.  Competition Pressure  On the other hand, Coditas operates in a highly competitive industry environment with both onshore and offshore service providers. Offshore firms benefit from significant cost advantages, which leads to lowering labour costs by 50-70% \(Putri 2025\). At the same time, the onshore providers distinguish themselves by their close collaboration with the clients and higher local expertise. As cost advantages are widely shared and competition is high, firms cannot rely on pricing to differentiate. Instead, the competitive advantage for a company lies in its efficiency in execution capabilities and high-quality services. Ultimately, the delivery of high-quality services lies in the capability of the engineers within the organization, making effective talent management critical for sustaining this competitive advantage.  Human Capital as a Key Success Factor )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
