/S /H1
/P 122 0 R
/T (Implication for Coditas  These factors together underscore the necessity for Coditas to optimize its management of employee skills. Skill shortage restricts the ability for potential expansion via recruitment, while competition demands quicker and more precise creation of teams capable of producing better results for clients. Additionally, the economic importance of human capital increases the cost of inefficiencies and waste of talent utilisation. Therefore, improving the visibility and accessibility of workforce skills is not only operational improvement but a necessary capability for Coditas to remain competitive, utilise resources efficiently to drive sustain growth.  Internal Context )
/E (Implication for Coditas  These factors together underscore the necessity for Coditas to optimize its management of employee skills. Skill shortage restricts the ability for potential expansion via recruitment, while competition demands quicker and more precise creation of teams capable of producing better results for clients. Additionally, the economic importance of human capital increases the cost of inefficiencies and waste of talent utilisation. Therefore, improving the visibility and accessibility of workforce skills is not only operational improvement but a necessary capability for Coditas to remain competitive, utilise resources efficiently to drive sustain growth.  Internal Context )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
239 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 122 0 R
/T (Overall, the skill data in Coditas is incomplete, inconsistent for organizational purposes. Although many engineers record their skills through tools such as Google Forms, the updates cannot be captured properly as everything depends on manual entries. Meanwhile, the recorded data is scattered throughout various places and fails to produce a coherent picture. Consequently, the managers fail to see a comprehensive view of all available skills and end up making inefficient and suboptimal staffing decisions. )
/E (Overall, the skill data in Coditas is incomplete, inconsistent for organizational purposes. Although many engineers record their skills through tools such as Google Forms, the updates cannot be captured properly as everything depends on manual entries. Meanwhile, the recorded data is scattered throughout various places and fails to produce a coherent picture. Consequently, the managers fail to see a comprehensive view of all available skills and end up making inefficient and suboptimal staffing decisions. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
