/T (Low skills visibility leads to inefficiency in terms of searching for potential candidates within the company. Hence, there are potential costs associated with the use of managerial time. According to the estimates, the cost equals to $47,727 per year \(Appendix A\). )
/E (Low skills visibility leads to inefficiency in terms of searching for potential candidates within the company. Hence, there are potential costs associated with the use of managerial time. According to the estimates, the cost equals to $47,727 per year \(Appendix A\). )
