/Title (Implication for Coditas  These factors together underscore the necessity for Coditas to optimize its management of employee skills. Skill shortage restricts the ability for potential expansion via recruitment, while competition demands quicker and more precise creation of teams capable of producing better results for clients. Additionally, the economic importance of human capital increases the cost of inefficiencies and waste of talent utilisation. Therefore, improving the visibility and accessibility of workforce skills is not only operational improvement but a necessary capability for Coditas to remain competitive, utilise resources efficiently to drive sustain growth.  Internal Context)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1045 0 R
/Next 1278 0 R
>>
endobj
