/Title (Overall, the skill data in Coditas is incomplete, inconsistent for organizational purposes. Although many engineers record their skills through tools such as Google Forms, the updates cannot be captured properly as everything depends on manual entries. Meanwhile, the recorded data is scattered throughout various places and fails to produce a coherent picture. Consequently, the managers fail to see a comprehensive view of all available skills and end up making inefficient and suboptimal staffing decisions.)
