/Title (Finally, it should be noted that the inefficiency caused by low skills visibility can become more severe as the company scales. The increase in both the number of employees and the size of the company makes it more difficult to maintain efficient communication, leading to greater search cost and suboptimal staffing. The sensitivity analysis \(Appendix)
