/Title (Another crucial risk related to the inaccurate or incomplete data sets, which could reduce the quality of team formation and could introduce system bluffing \(Mohammed et al., 2025\). In order to mitigate this issue, the system will require continuous data training. Moreover, data that is being used to train must also be validated to remove outliers and reduce noise. Feedback loops, and user manual inputs and adjustments can also be considered as valuable data points that should be collected and analysed.)
